i'm trevor shonk i'm a kennedy county  councillor member for ramsgate my name's  heather keane and i'm the councillor or  one of the councillors in cliftonville  westward my name is kerry boyd and i  cover garland ward i'm councillor ruth  bailey and i represent viking ward in  broadstairs yeah i'm councillor horis  schrub and i represent cliftonville east  my name is cancer george cupp i'm the  cabinet member for community safety and  youth engagement and i represent burst  and south on the tandem gesture council  [Music]  i wanted to become a counselor because i  wanted to have a better representation  within that so i looked at the  representation that there already was  and felt that there wasn't anyone that  really i could relate to and i think  it's important that if you have people  that are making decisions  and the public can relate to them so for  me i was like i couldn't really see many  young people certainly couldn't see many  young females  and so yeah i guess it was more about  better representation because i've  always been really interested in local  democracy and people having a say  and so actually being the representative  for people in a ward just really  appealed to me to sort of give the local  voice to it i've lived in birchtoon all  of my life and wanted to really be able  to give back to the people that i've  lived around in the community that i've  loved to live in and wanted to try and  make a difference  and i thought that a lot of the  decisions that were being made  would um be possibly a benefit if  younger people were involved with that i  worked a lot in the community anyway um  with various  various different groups organizations  and  i just thought it was the next step i  used to come to a lot of council  meetings too and uh and watch those and  um i just got interested in the politics  and local politics and um i just thought  it was the next step for me just make a  difference really  instead of sitting back moaning and i do  my own because on that age  uh i tried to listen to everybody's  views it was my first time i'd never  done anything like this before  so i was just quite interested really to  find out more about it and having found  out more about it then i put myself  forward so yeah  [Music]
 

